flowchart TB
    CU([Customer]) --> HD[Help desk · verified sender email]
    HD --> GU[Injection guard<br/>text = data, never instructions]
    GU --> RO["1 · ROUTER — classify_ticket()<br/>auto_close · route_to_human · escalate · unknown"]
    RO --> RE[2 · ReAct LOOP<br/>think → call tool → observe → write scratchpad]
    RE --> EV[3 · EVALUATOR — Reflexion critic<br/>checks every draft reply]
    EV -. revise once .-> RE

    RE --> CTL{{CONTROLS LAYER — enforced in code<br/>allowlist · approval binding · retry 1-2-4 s · breaker · 12 steps · 3 questions}}

    CTL --> RD[Read · auto<br/>lookup_customer · lookup_order · list_orders · search_kb]
    CTL --> WR[Write · auto, reversible<br/>update_ticket · escalate_case]
    CTL --> GATED[Gated · after human approval<br/>send_reply · issue_refund + idempotency key]
    CTL -. blocked .-x NX[NOT EXPOSED<br/>change_account_email · update_payment_method<br/>close_account · refund_override]

    GATED <--> SA[Support agent<br/>every reply · refunds ≤ NZ$100]
    GATED <--> MG[Manager<br/>refunds &gt; NZ$100]
    WR --> LS[Legal / Security<br/>two-factor with counter-model]
    WR --> AT[Accounts team<br/>all account changes]

    RE <--> SP[(Working scratchpad<br/>per ticket)]
    RO --> SK[(Procedural skills<br/>loaded per class)]
    EV --> EP[(Episodic memory<br/>cases + lessons per customer)]

    GATED --> OUT([Approved reply to customer])

    classDef human fill:#ede9fe,stroke:#6d28d9,color:#3b0764
    classDef bad fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#7f1d1d,stroke-dasharray:4 3
    classDef mem fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,color:#78350f
    classDef ctl fill:#e0f2fe,stroke:#0369a1,color:#0c4a6e
    classDef gate fill:#fae8ff,stroke:#a21caf,color:#4a044e
    class SA,MG,LS,AT human
    class NX bad
    class SP,EP,SK mem
    class CTL ctl
    class GATED gate
